  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "不轉過身跟<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳說話，\n我真的很抱歉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8F49904E8EAB8DDF00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAA8A71FF0C000A6211771F76845F8862B16B49300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其實我扭傷了腰，痛到不行……\n正是所謂的閃到腰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765BE66211626D50B74E868170FF0C75DB52304E0D884C20262026000A6B63662F62408B027684958352308170300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我痛到動彈不得，\n想叫誰來幫忙也痛苦得叫不了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621175DB523052D55F484E0D5F97FF0C000A60F353EB8AB04F865E6B5FD94E5F75DB82E65F9753EB4E0D4E86300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我之前閃到腰的時候，\n是用寶可夢的招式治好的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E4B524D958352308170768466425019FF0C000A662F75285BF653EF5922768462DB5F0F6CBB597D7684300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我記得……\n應該是叫做<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>蛸固<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的招式。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118A185F9720262026000A61C98A72662F53EB505A00100002FF00000686F856FA00100002FF000000768462DB5F0F300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真抱歉，\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳對我使出蛸固吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>八爪武師<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>這種寶可夢能學會這個招式。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F62B16B49FF0C000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35C0D62114F7F51FA86F856FA5427300200100001BE00000A00100002FF000006516B722A6B665E2B00100002FF00000090197A2E5BF653EF592280FD5B7867039019500B62DB5F0F300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳……\n是我最後的希望……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B320262026000A662F621167005F8C76845E0C671B2026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "求求<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳……\n讓<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>八爪武師<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>對我使出<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>蛸固<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>吧……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 16,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C426C4200100003110000FF01014F6059B320262026000A8B9300100002FF000006516B722A6B665E2B00100002FF0000005C0D62114F7F51FA00100002FF00000686F856FA00100002FF00000054272026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊啊啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554A554A554AFF01FF0100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "腰痛加上中招的痛！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "817075DB52A04E0A4E2D62DB768475DBFF01FF0100100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被固定住的地方漸漸舒緩了……\n雖然腰痛的時候是不該按摩的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB56FA5B9A4F4F7684573065B96F386F3882127DE94E8620262026000A96D67136817075DB768466425019662F4E0D8A72630964697684300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不對……這個蛸固……\n是因為避開我腰痛的地方所以有效嗎……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5C0D202620269019500B86F856FA20262026000A662F56E070BA907F958B6211817075DB7684573065B962404EE56709654855CE2026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蛸固讓我閃到腰的疼痛\n漸漸地消失了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "86F856FA8B936211958352308170768475BC75DB000A6F386F3857306D8859314E862026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "得救了！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳真是個善良的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9765514E86FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3771F662F500B5584826F76844EBA300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然蛸固的威力驚人，\n比閃到腰還來得痛苦就是了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713686F856FA76845A01529B9A5A4EBAFF0C000A6BD495835230817090844F865F9775DB82E65C31662F4E862026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "八爪武師，也謝謝你了！\n蛸固的威力實在是不得了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516B722A6B665E2BFF0C4E5F8B1D8B1D4F604E86FF01000A86F856FA76845A01529B5BE65728662F4E0D5F974E862026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "八爪武師……不對，\n烏賊王，也謝謝你了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n蛸固的威力實在是不得了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516B722A6B665E2B202620264E0D5C0DFF0C000A70CF8CCA738BFF0C4E5F8B1D8B1D4F604E86FF0100100001BE00000A86F856FA76845A01529B5BE65728662F4E0D5F974E862026202600100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "健康的腰，健康的人生。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50655EB776848170FF0C50655EB776844EBA751F300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "腰一閃，人生是黑白的。\n想做好覺悟的時間都只是奢求。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81704E009583FF0C4EBA751F662F9ED1767D76843002000A60F3505A597D89BA609F76846642959390FD53EA662F59626C42300200100002011401BA0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "腰總是閃得突然。\n為了不要留下後悔的瞬間，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳能珍惜每一分每一秒。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81707E3D662F95835F977A8171363002000A70BA4E864E0D898175594E0B5F8C6094768477AC9593FF0C00100001BE00000A5E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B380FD73CD60DC6BCF4E0052066BCF4E0079D2300200100002011401BA0000",
